  data: {
    LLM: "Focus on building a strong hand in one suit. The maximum is 41 (Ace + King + Horse + Jack of the same suit). Don't hold onto weak cards hoping they'll improve.\n\nWatch what cards other players take from the monte - this reveals what suits they're building. If you see someone take a Coin card, they likely have other Coin cards in hand.\n\nThe dealer has a significant advantage by seeing the monte first. As dealer, consider taking the monte as your hand if it's strong - this immediately knocks and limits other players to one exchange. Timing your knock is crucial - knock early with a good hand to prevent opponents from improving.",
    Player: "Focus on building a strong hand in one suit. The maximum is 41 (Ace + King + Horse + Jack of the same suit). Don't hold onto weak cards hoping they'll improve.\n\nWatch what cards other players take from the monte - this reveals what suits they're building. If you see someone take a Coin card, they likely have other Coin cards in hand.\n\nThe dealer has a significant advantage by seeing the monte first. As dealer, consider taking the monte as your hand if it's strong - this immediately knocks and limits other players to one exchange. Timing your knock is crucial - knock early with a good hand to prevent opponents from improving.",
